OL,3,ACrimean Bridge attacked again, Russia
OL,4,Asays
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Crimean Bridge has been attacked by
OL,7,FUkraine for the third time this week,
OL,8,FRussia has said.
OL,10,FThe Moscow-installed head of Crimea,
OL,11,FSergei Aksyonov, said that rail traffic
OL,12,Fwas temporarily suspended following
OL,13,Fanother strike on the bridge connecting
OL,14,FRussia to occupied Crimea.
OL,16,FOn Tuesday, Ukrainian missiles and
OL,17,Fdrones destroyed the central road
OL,18,Fsection of the critical bridge,
OL,19,Fcollapsing part of it into the water.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
